<title>NEW ZEALAND: CHH buys Forward for A$125 million.</title>
<headline>CHH buys Forward for A$125 million.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carter Holt Harvey Ltd said it had completed the purchase of Australia's Forward Products in August for A$125 million.</p>
<p>&quot;This purchase enables the company to take a strategic position in the Australian softwood markets and makes CHH the second largest marketer of wood products in the Australian market,&quot; Chief Executive John Faraci said.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
